sequenceDiagram
   
    participant Customer
    participant WebApp
    participant MenuService 
    participant DB

    Customer->>WebApp: Request restaurant menu
    WebApp->>MenuService: GET menu data /restaurant[id]/menu
    MenuService->>DB: Query menu data for restaurant[id]
    DB-->>MenuService: Return menu data

    alt Restaurant open
        MenuService-->>WebApp: 200 OK, menu[items enabled]
        WebApp-->>Customer: Display menu data, items addable to cart
    else Restaurant closed
        MenuService-->>WebApp: 200 OK,menu[items disabled]
        WebApp-->>Customer: Display menu data, items not addable to cart
    end